  "audio_draft": [
    {
      "id": "ad_01",
      "text": "站住。听说你在这屋里横得很？出来混，是要有本事的。",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "segment_ids": [
        "seg_1",
        "seg_2"
      ],
      "speaker": {
        "window_id": "vl_50ace3a7fd3225dd",
        "role_id": "F"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad_02",
      "text": "本事？你看我这身板，这排面，天生的主角相。你就叫我大人物好了，我承受得起。",
      "voice": "Serena",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "segment_ids": [
        "seg_3"
      ],
      "speaker": {
        "window_id": "vl_50ace3a7fd3225dd",
        "role_id": "A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad_03",
      "text": "瞧见没，我这一亮相，连长辈都得先看我。跟我作对的人，先掂量掂量。",
      "voice": "Serena",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "segment_ids": [
        "seg_4"
      ],
      "speaker": {
        "window_id": "vl_0f165248b8eec389",
        "role_id": "A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad_04",
      "text": "还有这宝物，乖乖躺在我怀里。这派头，走到哪儿都是场面。",
      "voice": "Serena",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "segment_ids": [
        "seg_5"
      ],
      "speaker": {
        "window_id": "vl_86fbda064b84ae10",
        "role_id": "A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad_05",
      "text": "啪嚓——哦，宝物碎了。你这个大人物，原来就是个砸东西的。",
      "voice": "Moon",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "segment_ids": [
        "seg_6"
      ],
      "speaker": {
        "window_id": "vl_86fbda064b84ae10",
        "role_id": "B"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad_06",
      "text": "场面撑得再足，一秒就露馅。听说他连对手最后都变成了抱他的人。",
      "voice": "Moon",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "segment_ids": [
        "seg_6",
        "seg_7"
      ],
      "speaker": {
        "window_id": "vl_86fbda064b84ae10",
        "role_id": "B"
      },
      "identity_anchor_segment_id": "seg_6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad_07",
      "text": "摆谱撑场面，摔的就是自己。",
      "voice": "Moon",
      "mode": "narration",
      "segment_ids": [
        "seg_7"
      ],
      "audio_relation": [
        {
          "segment_id": "seg_7",
          "relation": "narration"
        }
      ]
    }
